# Research Paper Assistant - RAG

An AI-powered assistant to chat with your research papers using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

Upload your PDF research papers and ask questions - get accurate answers with citations from your documents.

### Live Demo
**https://researech-paper-assistant-rag.vercel.app**

### Features
- 📄 Upload multiple research papers (PDF)
- 💬 Chat with your papers using AI
- 🔍 RAG-based accurate answers with source references `[Source: paper.pdf | Page 2]`
- ⚡ FastAPI backend + modern UI
- ☁️ Deployed on Vercel

### Tech Stack
- **Backend:** FastAPI, Python
- **AI / RAG:** LangChain, Google Gemini API, FAISS Vector Store
- **PDF Processing:** PyPDF2 / pdfplumber
- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Jinja2 Templates)
- **Deployment:** Vercel

### Project Structure

Researech_Paper_Assistant_RAG/
├── main.py              # FastAPI app + RAG logic
├── requirements.txt     # Python dependencies
